用","2026-11-11",14,"Chrome XML 双重释放漏洞 CVE-2026-125350 已被在野利用","2026-11-12",15,"ConnectWise 调查针对 MSP 的 ScreenConnect 恶意软件活动，47 家组织受影响","2026-11-13",16,"攻击者利用 4,837 个劫持 GitHub 账户在 1,806+ 个仓库运行 CI 密钥窃取器","2026-11-14",17,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","2026-11-21",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用","2026-11-22",25,"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 四项漏洞列入 KEV","2026-11-23",26,"Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-125396 已复现","2026-11-24",27,"GT13 攻击活动入侵 Check Point Security Management Servers，至少影响 22 家组织","2026-11-25",28,"BabidiGhost 借助越狱 AI 代理攻击欧洲多行业机构并窃取 8.6 GB 档案","2026-11-26",29,"GeoServer 未认证远程代码执行漏洞链 CVE-2026-129242 等已复现",30,"Drupal 安装器补丁遗漏导致 CVE-2026-136716 已被在野利用","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-08","generatedAt","2026-11-08T00:00:42.536Z","lead",{"_55":77,"_273":267},"leadItemId","xr0vtk5687xc31yatwi6m3z0m","overview","highlights",[270,271,272],"sections",[204,205,206],"flashes",[168,169,170],"cover",{"_161":162,"_163":164,"_165":-5,"_166":-5,"_167":-5},"metrics",{"_157":67,"_158":61,"_159":50,"_160":52},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased","firstPartyEvents","url","/dailyinfo/media/c995a61696cb7184.jpg","srcSet","/dailyinfo/media/51fecdf8cac9ef1b.jpg 720w, /dailyinfo/media/b7db55ed130e2737.jpg 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/c995a61696cb7184.jpg 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_171":199,"_55":200,"_174":201,"_176":194,"_178":202,"_180":203,"_182":197,"_184":198,"_186":189,"_188":189},{"_171":191,"_55":192,"_174":193,"_176":194,"_178":195,"_180":196,"_182":197,"_184":198,"_186":189,"_188":189},{"_171":172,"_55":173,"_174":175,"_176":177,"_178":179,"_180":181,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_188":189,"_190":66},"itemId","xjtk4qapk0fz040tt5c9vm102","WordPress CVE-2026-119977 已在野利用，安装修复时仍可能再次被攻破","summary","WordPress CVE-2026-119977 已被确认在野利用，但安装 7.1.4 修复版本时，部分站点仍会因旧版更新器使用可预测的 wp-content/upgrade 目录名而再次暴露安装器。","sourceName","The Hacker News","sourceUrl","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/installing-fix-for-exploited-wordpress.html","publishedAt","2026-11-06T16:08:38.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"followUp","wlow3wts75k3iwu5wwonpyqpi","LXD 恶意镜像可经 templates 符号链接读写宿主机任意文件","LXD 可被构造的恶意容器镜像利用，通过未拦截的顶层 templates 符号链接读取或创建及写入宿主机任意目录中的文件，进而可能执行任意命令。PoC 将 templates 映射至宿主机 /etc/cron.d，并创建以 root 身份运行 id 的定时任务，展示了读取、写入及命令执行路径。","GitHub 安全公告","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-jpf8-86f3-wp38","2026-11-06T18:53:57.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f426f4f60d806c23.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp 96w","xol3ijobpc59mci7fq0ae59nk","OSAC operator console-proxy 存在 kubeconfig 凭据插件执行与 SSRF 漏洞","OSAC operator 的 console-proxy 在解析 Kubernetes Secret 中的 kubeconfig 时未清理 exec 插件配置，可导致服务账户权限范围内远程代码执行，并通过攻击者控制的 clusters[].server 实施 SSRF。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-5w5g-j6hw-6p8f","2026-11-06T18:12:40.000Z",{"_207":244,"_174":-5,"_209":245},{"_207":217,"_174":-5,"_209":218},{"_207":208,"_174":-5,"_209":210},"label","AI 安全","items",[211],{"_171":212,"_55":213,"_174":214,"_176":177,"_178":215,"_180":216,"_182":183,"_184":185,"_186":187,"_188":189},"lumlbzum3afm0fmdtcxu7t21q","Claude Code 将批准命令中的密码与密钥明文保存在项目文件，GitHub 发现 1,122 份公开副本","Claude Code 在用户选择“Yes, and don't ask again”后，会将批准的命令原样写入 .claude/settings.local.json，若命令含密码或令牌也会以明文保存。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/claude-codes-dont-ask-again-file.html","2026-11-07T06:44:17.000Z","攻击与威胁",[219,220,221],{"_171":236,"_55":237,"_174":238,"_176":239,"_178":240,"_180":241,"_182":242,"_184":243,"_186":187,"_188":189},{"_171":228,"_55":229,"_174":230,"_176":231,"_178":232,"_180":233,"_182":234,"_184":235,"_186":187,"_188":189},{"_171":222,"_55":223,"_174":224,"_176":225,"_178":226,"_180":227,"_182":-5,"_186":187,"_188":189},"cd10ku2jyo2zjhf6tnrhavx0z","Storm-3358 扩大利用 ARTEX 攻击东南亚及全球金融机构","Storm-3358 于 2026 年 10 月起使用 agentic AI 渗透测试框架 ARTEX 攻击东南亚金融机构及少量全球大型金融组织。该入侵团伙结合传统自动化工具扫描公网系统，利用匿名文件上传、SSRF 等缺陷，安装 WISP、vshell 和 AdaptixC2 RAT，并通过 Web shell、泄露凭据、云身份及暴力破解开展持久化、横向移动、提权与数据外传。","Microsoft Security Blog","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/11/06/artex-abuse-expands-as-cybercriminals-target-financial-sector/","2026-11-07T02:44:34.000Z","ucovakubvkebsauqv049n97vi","Hunt.io 披露 ARTEX 攻击韩国 7 家金融机构数据泄露","Hunt.io 追踪了 ARTEX 开源自主渗透测试框架及其 AI 攻击基础设施，关联 2026 年 9 月底至 10 月初韩国 7 家金融机构通过互联网暴露系统发起的泄露事件，影响约 66,000 至 67,000 人和约 2,200 家公司，个人、就业、收入与贷款数据外泄。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/202607/ai/inside-artex-ai-hacking-tools-exposed-servers-and-south-korean-bank-breaches.html","2026-11-07T19:56:18.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","qt4a7nln856uan1eob526jcmp","QNAP称Plex2Shell漏洞链已被用于入侵NAS设备","Plex2Shell漏洞链已被用于攻击暴露在公网的QNAP NAS，QNAP称已收到多起客户设备疑似失陷报告。该漏洞链包含CVE-2026-96652、CVE-2026-96654、CVE-2026-96655和CVE-2026-96656，CISA于2026年10月20日将其列入KEV目录。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/qnap-says-hackers-breaching-nas-devices-in-plex2shell-attacks/","2026-11-06T17:04:23.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","漏洞与在野利用",[246,247,248,249],{"_171":142,"_55":77,"_174":267,"_176":239,"_178":268,"_180":269,"_182":242,"_184":243,"_186":187,"_188":189},{"_171":260,"_55":261,"_174":262,"_176":263,"_178":264,"_180":265,"_182":-5,"_186":189,"_188":189,"_266":48,"_190":72},{"_171":255,"_55":256,"_174":257,"_176":194,"_178":258,"_180":259,"_182":197,"_184":198,"_186":189,"_188":189},{"_171":250,"_55":251,"_174":252,"_176":194,"_178":253,"_180":254,"_182":197,"_184":198,"_186":189,"_188":189},"mrpepymif8ptdu6v6wcid81kx","LXD 镜像 URL 导入功能存在 SSRF，可探测内部网络","LXD 的 POST /1.0/images 镜像 URL 导入功能存在 SSRF，具备 can_create_images 权限的用户可让守护进程请求回环地址、RFC1918 私网及 169.254.169.254 等云元数据端点。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-3gq2-x4qg-p4g6","2026-11-06T18:29:18.000Z","hk714ipariljekiun88mpsvd2","LXD 快照绕过受限项目限制导致 Incus 服务器任意命令执行","LXD 的实例快照会忽略 `restricted.containers.lowlevel=block` 设置，攻击者可借助 `raw.lxc`、`raw.qemu` 等低层钩子，在 Incus 服务器上以 root 权限执行任意命令。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-47w9-6r3f-938g","2026-11-06T19:51:26.000Z","j353lmgbdt1vzxfl5am6xcscg","OpenSSH/musl密码认证绕过漏洞CVE-2026-123158已复现，受影响版本为7.3p1至10.6p2","绿盟科技CERT披露并成功复现OpenSSH/musl密码认证绕过漏洞CVE-2026-123158，CVSS评分为8.1。","绿盟科技CERT","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0MjE3ODkxNg==&mid=2247493747&idx=1&sn=db0e3b3dd13eaf2ba1ae1f7f34690a78","2026-11-06T10:03:00.000Z","otherSources","SonicWall SSL-VPN 的 SAML 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-19868 已被用于攻击，攻击者持有另一种认证方式的有效凭据后，可绕过 SAML 认证控制，包括 SAML 强制启用的 MFA。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/sonicwall-warns-of-new-ssl-vpn-mfa-bypass-flaw-exploited-in-attacks/","2026-11-07T00:00:55.000Z",{"_171":260,"_55":261,"_174":262,"_176":263,"_178":264,"_180":265,"_182":-5,"_186":189,"_188":189,"_266":48,"_190":72},{"_171":236,"_55":237,"_174":238,"_176":239,"_178":240,"_180":241,"_182":242,"_184":243,"_186":187,"_188":189},{"_171":228,"_55":229,"_174":230,"_176":231,"_178":232,"_180":233,"_182":234,"_184":235,"_186":187,"_188":189},"leadParagraph",{"_275":276,"_277":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
